---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy">
  <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
  <p class="msg" style="background:#fff3e0;border:1px solid #8a4b00">Draft. A qualified person must review this notice before real farmers use the service.</p>
  <h2>What we keep</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Your phone number is never stored as a number</strong> unless you ask for a call-back and say yes. For a saved profile we keep only a scrambled code (a keyed hash) that cannot be turned back into your number, plus your language, place and crop.</li>
    <li><strong>Call-back requests:</strong> if you say yes to a call-back, your number is kept for up to 30 days and then removed. If you say no, no number is kept.</li>
    <li><strong>Questions you type on this website</strong> are kept so an agent can answer them. A number you add is kept only if you tick the consent box, and removed after 30 days.</li>
    <li><strong>Telegram alerts (only if switched on):</strong> we keep your Telegram chat number and the place and crop you chose until you send <code>/stop</code>, which deletes them. Alerts already sent are remembered only to avoid repeats.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage counts</strong> (for example how many sessions per day) contain no personal data.</li>
    <li><strong>Price agents:</strong> reports are linked to an agent code, not to a phone number.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Why</h2>
  <p>To show you the farm brief, weather and prices for your place and crop, and to let an agent answer your questions.</p>
  <h2>How to delete your data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>On a phone:</strong> dial the service, choose <em>My settings</em>, then <em>Delete my data</em> and confirm. Your saved profile and consent are removed at once. Call-back requests are removed within 30 days.</li>
    <li><strong>On this website:</strong> use the form below.</li>
  </ul>
  <form id="del" novalidate>
    <label for="note">What should we delete? (optional)</label><textarea id="note" maxlength="500"></textarea>
    <label for="contact">How can we confirm with you? (optional, phone or email)</label><input id="contact" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" />
    <p><button type="submit">Send deletion request</button></p>
  </form>
  <p id="out" class="msg hidden" role="status"></p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>AgriNova team (Israel Olanrewaju and Theophilus Oyekola), makers of AgriVoice.</p>
  <p>Email: <a href="mailto:oluwaolapelumi@gmail.com">oluwaolapelumi@gmail.com</a>. Phone: <a href="tel:+2348088585887">08088585887</a>.</p>
  <h2>Weather</h2>
  <p>Weather data by Open-Meteo.com. We send only the coordinates of your LGA or state to them, never your phone number.</p>
</Base>
<script>import '../scripts/privacy.ts';</script>
